description:
payment-header-check: Payment Header Check API: reads an x402 PAYMENT-SIGNATURE header before you send it - base64/UTF-8/JSON, version, authorization fields, clock window, who signed and, with the seller's PAYMENT-REQUIRED, payTo/amount/network/asset. Nothing is sent anywhere. $0.005 USDC per check (1 cent is this catalog's minimum).
Method: POST
Input: {"payment_signature": "string, required", "payment_required": "string, optional"}
